Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 04:50:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST War: flag SiegeFormation (classical-medieval land
 city attacks use the basic attack force: 5 siege/ranged slots, not 2; off in
 the bundle)

Bully conquest pair 0879B791: the small city attack force has only 2 siege or
ranged slots (both required); its optional slots are melee. So SiegeArmy's
extra build requests were Pictish Warriors and Swordsmen, catapults couldn't
join past 2, and 7 units made 27 damage a turn against a bar of 60.
GetFormationType() applies the override everywhere CvAIOperation looks up its
formation (Init, PreconditionsAreMet).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZizcmgfGkXsgJcVcF7h
